          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, consider the situation given in Fig. 8.2. The girl sitting on the balcony is looking down at a flower pot placed on a stair of the temple. In this case, the line of sight is below the horizontal level. The angle so formed by the line of sight with the horizontal is called the angle of depression."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.479,
            0.902,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, the "
            },
